.DS_Store
# data / secrets — never commit vendor data or API keys
data/
*.csv
*.parquet
.env

# ...except the fund-holdings archive. This is the one dataset in the project
# that cannot be re-bought at any price: holdings are published daily and
# overwritten, so a day not captured is a day gone forever, and the crowding
# study in PREREGISTRATION.md 2.2 needs ~18 months of them. Leaving it under
# `*.csv` meant the irreplaceable data was the only data with no version
# control and no backup, sitting on one laptop.
!holdings/
!holdings/**/
!holdings/**/*.csv
!holdings/**/*.json
